WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.930
<b>Filming in Progress</b>

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:07.190
Welcome to the 32nd Annual T-1 Grand Prix!

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.320
<b>T - 1 
Grand
 Prix</b>

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:15.640
I can't believe it's already time
 for the T-1 Grand Prix again!

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:19.480
Who will shine brightest in the 
world of stand-up comedy this year?

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:21.330
Your hosts today are the two of us, as usual!

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:23.070
Say our names, at least!

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:24.710
And let me introduce our judges!

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:30.190
They're the same judges as last year!

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:33.300
Please introduce them properly!

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:34.600
Moving on for now—

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:35.950
Can you do that?!

00:00:35.950 --> 00:00:39.600
—let's introduce this year's 
Secret Guest Judges!

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:42.020
Yes, this year we have two of them!

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:44.100
Our first Secret Guest Judge is

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:46.400
the vocalist of CRUSHERZ, Shougo!

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:49.270
Thanks for having me today—WISH!

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:53.120
Shougo-san, we hear you 
watch a lot of stand-up comedy.

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:55.110
Yes. I absolutely love stand-up comedy,

00:00:55.110 --> 00:00:56.770
so I'm super-excited to be here today!

00:00:56.770 --> 00:01:00.170
So excited, my heart is 
totally skipping a beat!

00:01:00.950 --> 00:01:02.690
And our second Secret Guest Judge is...

00:01:02.690 --> 00:01:04.410
...Ichijou Ryouma!

00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:06.370
<b>GLOOOOM</b>

00:01:07.970 --> 00:01:12.630
We hear you're also a fan of stand-up comedy.
What are you looking forward to tonight?

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:15.340
Ichijou-san?

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:16.620
Yeah...

00:01:16.620 --> 00:01:19.910
I'd really like to... 
be able to laugh today...

00:01:19.910 --> 00:01:21.390
Good for you, Ryouma-kun!

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:22.970
You've just set the bar 
super-high, in that case!

00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:27.410
We've got some feisty guest judges this year!

00:01:27.410 --> 00:01:28.540
The barrier between our contestants

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:31.700
and dominion over the stand-up 
comedy world is Ichijou Ryoma!

00:01:32.390 --> 00:01:33.690
<i>Ryouma-kun...</i>

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:36.800
Next time we meet, 
I won't show you any mercy!

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:39.530
As his older brother, I will 
avenge him with these hands!

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:41.690
<i>...that's what I intended.</i>

00:01:41.690 --> 00:01:45.540
<i>But I just can't summon up those feelings 
against Ryouma-kun when he's like this...</i>

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:48.000
What a huge miscalculation!

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:22.220
All right.

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:24.990
That's all the desk work for today.

00:03:28.340 --> 00:03:31.600
I suppose it's time I did 
something about <i>that</i>.

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:33.600
<b><i>But I Do Like You</i></b>

00:03:34.600 --> 00:03:37.520
<i>Based on the circumstances, 
I do sympathize with him.</i>

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:39.820
<i>But I need to drag him back out into the world</i>

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:41.200
<i>before he becomes a permanent shut-in.</i>

00:03:57.790 --> 00:03:59.260
It was a shock...

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:08.930
No!

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:10.130
So embarrassing! So embarrassing!

00:04:10.130 --> 00:04:11.720
So embarrassing! So embarrassing! 
So embarrassing!

00:04:11.720 --> 00:04:14.050
Why do I keep remembering 
that over and over again?!

00:04:14.050 --> 00:04:17.020
What am I, BL? A BL uke?!

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:20.200
Izumi-san? How long do you 
intend to stay in there?

00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:20.940
Rei?

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:23.550
Aren't your exams starting soon?

00:04:23.550 --> 00:04:25.710
It's a student's job to study, you know!

00:04:25.710 --> 00:04:28.450
There are more important 
things than studying!

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:29.890
Leave me alone!

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:33.020
You know I can't do that.

00:04:33.020 --> 00:04:34.330
If you don't go to class,

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:36.840
your grades will drop, and you'll 
have to retake this year!

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:37.860
That's fine with me!

00:04:37.860 --> 00:04:40.570
I don't care about grades 
or college or anything!

00:04:40.570 --> 00:04:44.630
Izumi-san, if you're going to be like that,
 what will you do with your future?

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:47.490
It's my life! You don't need 
to lecture me about it!

00:04:47.490 --> 00:04:48.750
If I want to repeat a 
year of school, I will!

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:50.560
It's none of your business!

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:51.770
Who

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:53.600
do you think you're kidding here?!

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:56.480
If you want to repeat a 
year of school, you will?!

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:58.840
And who pays those damned expensive 
tuition fees for you, huh?!

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:00.390
Your father, Seiya-san, that's who!

00:05:00.390 --> 00:05:02.320
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:04.680
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:08.070
If you understand that, 
then it's time to come out of your room.

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:13.520
There's no way you'd understand 
how I feel, Rei...

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:15.620
I do understand.

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:16.460
Huh?

00:05:16.660 --> 00:05:18.380
Understand what?

00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:22.420
How it feels to be held down by another man.

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:29.510
Huh?!

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:29.510
<b>HUUUUUUUUUHHHH?!</b>

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:32.780
Then, you mean you've done a man despite 
being a man, to a man, with a man?!

00:05:32.780 --> 00:05:33.930
Shh!

00:05:34.790 --> 00:05:36.730
Well, as much as the next person, yes.

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:38.690
<i>He said it like he's brushing off praise!</i>

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:40.150
In any case!

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:40.150
<b>In Any Case</b>

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:42.000
As the experienced party,

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:45.080
I'm telling you to stop moping 
over a thwarted attempt like that.

00:05:45.080 --> 00:05:47.600
In the end, it wasn't any worse
 than a mosquito bite.

00:05:47.600 --> 00:05:49.510
Huh? That was all?

00:05:49.510 --> 00:05:51.280
Yes, that was all.

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:51.410
Really?

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:52.370
Really?        Who knows?

00:05:52.710 --> 00:05:53.680
Then...

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:54.640
Um...

00:05:54.640 --> 00:05:56.800
Can I ask you something?

00:05:57.950 --> 00:05:59.170
What is it?

00:05:59.490 --> 00:06:01.670
Can guys get aroused from 
having their nipples touched?

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:03.090
Indeed they can!

00:06:04.100 --> 00:06:05.920
R-Really?! You, too, Rei?!

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:07.350
Yes, most certainly.

00:06:07.350 --> 00:06:08.680
Yay!

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:11.570
So I'm not a BL character after all!

00:06:11.570 --> 00:06:14.850
<i>What kinds of things was he worrying about?!</i>

00:06:15.070 --> 00:06:16.450
Then I'm going to school!

00:06:16.450 --> 00:06:17.870
Huh? Now?

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:19.900
I'm gonna go drop in at my manga club.

00:06:20.570 --> 00:06:22.150
I'm heading out!

00:06:22.600 --> 00:06:23.710
Come back safely.

00:06:25.640 --> 00:06:29.130
<i>It'd be one thing if Ichijou Ryouma 
had attacked Izumi in drag,</i>

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:32.560
<i>but he did it when Izumi 
was back to normal...</i>

00:06:34.090 --> 00:06:37.150
<i>I wonder if I could use this situation 
to our advantage, somehow...</i>

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:38.250
<b>You schemer!</b>

00:06:41.840 --> 00:06:42.500
<i>Shougo?</i>

00:06:43.530 --> 00:06:45.260
Hello, what is it?

00:06:45.260 --> 00:06:47.260
Are you done with today's TV taping?

00:06:47.980 --> 00:06:49.520
What? Izumi?

00:06:53.410 --> 00:06:54.930
What great weather!

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:58.390
<i>It really is better to be outside.</i>

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:01.760
<i>It makes it easier not 
to remember </i>that<i>, too...</i>

00:07:03.840 --> 00:07:05.930
<i>Once I get to the manga club, 
I should start drawing again!</i>

00:07:05.930 --> 00:07:07.940
<i>I've got to make up for the days I missed!</i>

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:08.920
No way!

00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:10.190
It's them, isn't it?

00:07:10.190 --> 00:07:10.870
Seriously?

00:07:10.870 --> 00:07:11.860
Should I tweet this?

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:13.140
No, dummy, don't!

00:07:13.140 --> 00:07:14.460
What's going on?

00:07:13.140 --> 00:07:14.550
Are they filming something here?

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:15.940
But there aren't any cameras around...

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:18.790
Excuse me, can I please get through?

00:07:15.940 --> 00:07:17.720
They're probably filming them from afar.

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:22.810
Yep, yep, it just came to me!

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:26.250
I'll sing the melody to you right now,
 so can you record it for me?

00:07:32.170 --> 00:07:33.650
Guess what, right now, 
in front of the school—

00:07:33.650 --> 00:07:34.860
<i>Th-that's...</i>

00:07:33.650 --> 00:07:34.860
It's really them, really!

00:07:34.860 --> 00:07:35.600
What are they filming?

00:07:37.030 --> 00:07:37.680
Izumi!

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:39.800
Huh? Izumi?

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:43.560
Izumi...

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:45.060
I...

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:48.250
No!

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:48.980
Izumi!

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:51.080
Wait, please, Izumi!

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:52.730
H-hold on, Ryouma-kun—

00:07:52.730 --> 00:07:53.780
Oh my gosh, it's really Shougo!

00:07:54.390 --> 00:07:55.890
Shake my hand!

00:07:55.890 --> 00:07:58.040
Autograph! Autograph! Autograph!

00:08:01.310 --> 00:08:02.500
Izumi!

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:03.890
Wait!

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:05.570
Stop!

00:08:05.570 --> 00:08:06.670
Stop, please!

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:13.860
Don't... underestimate... an otaku!!

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:16.140
I told you to stop!

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:26.650
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:29.200
<i>I'm reaching the limit of my otaku stamina...</i>

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:30.820
<i>I've gotta shake him off somehow!</i>

00:08:31.130 --> 00:08:32.580
<i>Somehow...</i>

00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:42.790
<i>You're kidding! What is this?!</i>

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:53.770
<i>Wh-Why?</i>

00:08:56.940 --> 00:08:59.050
I finally caught up with you...

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:11.230
<i>No!</i>

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:12.940
<i>He's going to catch me!</i>

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:22.950
<i>No!</i>

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:24.580
<i>He's going to catch me!</i>

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:29.220
<i>It's too late!</i>

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:37.490
I'm so sorry!

00:09:37.920 --> 00:09:38.800
Huh?

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:41.370
I swear, I'll never do anything 
awful like that to you again,

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:43.270
so please, just hear me out!

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:44.390
I'm begging you, please!

00:09:45.760 --> 00:09:46.640
Is he kowtowing?

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:49.020
Wasn't there a TV drama like this?

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:50.360
Must be for a movie.

00:09:50.880 --> 00:09:52.730
It seems more like a novel, doesn't it?

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:54.570
It's totally a manga. A manga.

00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:56.570
It must be a TV drama.

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:57.710
A novel!

00:09:57.710 --> 00:09:58.450
No, a movie!

00:09:58.450 --> 00:09:59.210
I said it's a manga!

00:09:59.210 --> 00:10:00.130
A TV drama!

00:10:00.130 --> 00:10:01.160
Please!

00:10:01.400 --> 00:10:02.600
H-Hey...

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:04.270
Um... people are staring...

00:10:04.270 --> 00:10:05.370
Until you agree to hear me out,

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:07.450
I'll keep apologizing for 
as many hours as it takes!

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:09.860
Oh, look! I've seen him before!

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:09.860
All right, already!

00:10:09.860 --> 00:10:11.370
It must be a movie after all!

00:10:09.860 --> 00:10:12.460
I'll hear you out, so stop bowing already!

00:10:11.370 --> 00:10:12.460
No, it's a TV drama!

00:10:14.520 --> 00:10:15.500
Will you really?

00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:17.670
Yeah, so stand up already...

00:10:17.670 --> 00:10:18.590
Okay!

00:10:19.380 --> 00:10:20.440
Aw, is it over already?

00:10:20.440 --> 00:10:21.780
Boring...

00:10:20.440 --> 00:10:21.780
Leaving off in the middle...

00:10:21.780 --> 00:10:23.440
Time to work.

00:10:22.320 --> 00:10:24.260
I don't have a job.

00:10:24.780 --> 00:10:25.350
So...

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:26.880
What did you want to say?

00:10:28.450 --> 00:10:29.610
Um...

00:10:30.200 --> 00:10:31.150
Actually...

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:39.530
<b>DWEEBY</b>

00:10:37.640 --> 00:10:40.200
Hey, what did you want to say?

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:43.230
<i>Why did I have to fall 
for someone like this?!</i>

00:10:43.230 --> 00:10:44.700
Hurry up and tell me.

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:47.250
Before that, will you let me 
make some preparations?!

00:10:47.510 --> 00:10:48.480
Huh?

00:10:54.950 --> 00:10:55.840
<i>Hello?</i>

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:57.290
Hey, where are you?

00:10:57.290 --> 00:10:58.260
Right here!

00:10:58.610 --> 00:10:59.740
Here, here!

00:10:59.740 --> 00:11:01.760
Over here!

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:05.760
You seriously saved me, 
picking me up like this!

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:07.640
For a while there, I didn't 
know what I was going to do!

00:11:07.920 --> 00:11:13.200
So then, kindly explain how you 
ended up in this situation?

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:14.960
I'm extremely busy, you realize?

00:11:14.960 --> 00:11:16.880
Aw, sorry, sorry!

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:18.740
It's just, all this stuff happened and...

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:20.450
<b>A Few Hours Earlier</b>

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:23.660
<b>T-1 Grand Prix Taping
 Ichijou Ryouma-sama</b>

00:11:23.660 --> 00:11:24.990
I can't...

00:11:26.030 --> 00:11:28.810
It'll be okay! It's not a live broadcast!

00:11:27.020 --> 00:11:33.050
<b>Don't 
worry</b>

00:11:28.810 --> 00:11:32.170
And I'm sure they'll edit it to 
make you seem funnier... I think.

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:37.360
Oh! Ryouma-san, there's something 
seeping out of your mouth!

00:11:37.360 --> 00:11:39.370
Put it back in! Put it back in!

00:11:38.180 --> 00:11:39.840
<i>What is this, Ryouma-kun?</i>

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:41.720
There we go, see? Just swallow it back down!

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:43.340
<i>At this rate, how can I avenge Izumi?</i>

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:43.340
It's spilling out! It's spilling out!

00:11:44.080 --> 00:11:45.050
...to apologize...

00:11:45.050 --> 00:11:46.010
Huh?

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:49.600
I want to apologize to Izumi...

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:50.730
Huh?

00:11:51.850 --> 00:11:53.770
What's the point of saying that now?

00:11:53.770 --> 00:11:57.730
All you really want is to ease 
your guilty conscience, I bet!

00:11:57.730 --> 00:11:59.600
Isn't that right, Ryouma-kun?!

00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:01.570
Sh-Shougo-san?

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:11.000
I... I'm a failure of a human being!

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:11.960
Hey...

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:14.130
My life has no value! 
My existence has no value!

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:16.380
I am lower than a piece of garbage!

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:17.790
Hey, h-hold on a second!

00:12:18.140 --> 00:12:20.380
You're not lower than garbage!

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:22.320
Ryouma-kun, you work so hard at your job!

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:23.950
And you have real talent!

00:12:23.950 --> 00:12:24.550
But...

00:12:25.020 --> 00:12:27.230
I'll never get Izumi to forgive me...

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:30.780
F-Fine! I'll let you guys meet!

00:12:30.780 --> 00:12:33.140
But only if I'm there, too, got it?

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:36.480
Oh, brother-in-law!

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:38.440
Not that again!

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:41.110
But I ended up losing both of them,

00:12:41.690 --> 00:12:45.260
then I got swarmed by fans 
and lost my sunglasses,

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:47.990
so I had to keep myself hidden.

00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:50.770
Where could Izumi have gone?

00:12:55.490 --> 00:12:56.640
What are you doing?

00:12:56.640 --> 00:12:58.880
I figured something like this might happen,

00:12:58.880 --> 00:13:01.840
so I placed a tracking device in Izumi's bag.

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:02.590
Seriously?

00:13:02.900 --> 00:13:04.480
So you can track where he is?

00:13:04.480 --> 00:13:05.430
Yes.

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:07.300
In Urasandou?

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:11.180
Why would an otaku like Izumi go 
to a fashionable area like that?

00:13:12.320 --> 00:13:12.930
Oh!

00:13:13.440 --> 00:13:14.780
He went into a store!

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:18.450
Hey, hey! Do you have a tracker on me, too?

00:13:18.450 --> 00:13:20.900
I have no interest in your daily life.

00:13:21.210 --> 00:13:23.120
How could you say that?!

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:31.030
There, all finished!

00:13:31.570 --> 00:13:34.150
Ryouma-kun, what do you think of this style?

00:13:34.150 --> 00:13:36.520
Perfect! Amazing as always, Terry!

00:13:36.520 --> 00:13:39.980
Aww, a little thing like this
 was a piece of cake!

00:13:39.980 --> 00:13:40.790
Um...

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:42.350
Off to our next stop!

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:43.800
Come again!

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:46.170
Oh, my! It really suits him!

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:49.930
It isn't quite right.

00:13:51.550 --> 00:13:52.810
Next.

00:13:53.770 --> 00:13:55.480
Sort of...

00:13:56.900 --> 00:13:58.020
Ugh...

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:01.740
Yeah, that's about right!

00:14:01.740 --> 00:14:03.360
It looks wonderful on him!

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:06.190
You have a great eye, Ryouma-san!

00:14:06.190 --> 00:14:08.030
He'll wear it out like this, 
so can you remove the tags?

00:14:08.030 --> 00:14:09.410
Certainly!

00:14:10.430 --> 00:14:12.120
Hold on a second!

00:14:12.600 --> 00:14:14.960
What is all this? You can't just 
drag me around like this!

00:14:14.960 --> 00:14:16.960
What are you preparing for?

00:14:17.800 --> 00:14:19.670
This looks like a good spot.

00:14:20.770 --> 00:14:22.130
A good spot for what?

00:14:22.360 --> 00:14:24.510
You keep saying things that don't make sense.

00:14:24.510 --> 00:14:26.630
If you try to drag me anywhere else,

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:28.700
I won't go with you!

00:14:30.240 --> 00:14:31.850
Wh-What are you doing?

00:14:32.360 --> 00:14:34.750
Give me back my glasses.

00:14:36.570 --> 00:14:39.830
<i>S-So cute!</i>

00:14:38.110 --> 00:14:40.810
I can't see anything without my glasses.

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:42.730
Give it back!

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:43.400
<i>He really is the cutest thing ever!</i>

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:45.200
<i>Damn it all!</i>

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:47.110
I'll give them back once I've said my piece!

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:50.110
Huh? Then hurry up and get it over with.

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:51.940
How much more preparation do you need to—

00:14:55.430 --> 00:14:57.910
Are you... hungry?

00:14:58.970 --> 00:15:00.870
That's right, I was holed up in my room,

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:03.850
and then I left the house without eating.

00:15:03.850 --> 00:15:06.110
Then let's go get something to eat!

00:15:06.110 --> 00:15:08.000
It'll be my treat, as an apology for before!

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:09.430
Um, but...

00:15:09.430 --> 00:15:10.610
I want to take my time talking to you,

00:15:10.610 --> 00:15:12.640
so maybe we should go somewhere 
that has private rooms.

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:15.250
There's a good restaurant nearby—

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:19.270
<i>H-He's going to carry me off!</i>

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:19.520
<b>Private Room —> Alone Together —> DANGER!!</b>

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:22.350
I get it! I get it! No private rooms!

00:15:22.820 --> 00:15:25.230
Then, how about something like that? 
We can eat while we walk around!

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:27.320
Yay! Crepes!

00:15:34.850 --> 00:15:36.520
Delicious!

00:15:39.470 --> 00:15:40.660
You see, I...

00:15:43.490 --> 00:15:46.980
For a little while after that 
commercial we did ten years ago,

00:15:46.980 --> 00:15:49.460
my career as a child star went well.

00:15:50.250 --> 00:15:52.380
I appeared on dramas and a few variety shows.

00:15:53.020 --> 00:15:56.810
But as I grew older, a lot 
less work came in for me.

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:03.850
Even so, I wouldn't give up without a fight.

00:16:03.850 --> 00:16:07.700
So I went around begging agency heads 
and TV networks for work.

00:16:09.760 --> 00:16:13.260
I endured sexual harassment 
from asshole producers,

00:16:13.800 --> 00:16:15.840
accepted absolutely any job,

00:16:15.840 --> 00:16:18.410
and finally clawed my way, on hands and 
knees, into the entertainment world.

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:22.540
That's why, at the time, I was always 
in a bad mood, saying things like,

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:25.000
<b>Super-Popular!</b>

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:25.000
"Die, you damn heartthrobs!"

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:27.960
<b>Child of Show Biz Legends!</b>

00:16:25.320 --> 00:16:27.960
or "Die, useless coattail-riders!"

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:30.590
<b>GLOOOM</b>

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:30.880
Those thoughts filled my head every day.

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:34.180
And... that's why you hate my big brother?

00:16:34.560 --> 00:16:37.170
Yep! That's how he always is.

00:16:37.170 --> 00:16:39.640
In his case, there's more to it!

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:45.770
<b>Debut Single 
Ichijou Ryouma - "Run On"</b>

00:16:40.250 --> 00:16:43.030
Back when I'd finally gained some popularity 
thanks to a part in a TV drama,

00:16:43.030 --> 00:16:45.770
I was preparing to debut my first single.

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:49.660
But the same week, some stupid "CRUSHERZ 
Emergency Release" came out at the last minute,

00:16:49.660 --> 00:16:53.400
and even debuted at the top of the charts!

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:57.370
I'll hold a grudge against him 
for that until the end of time!

00:16:57.370 --> 00:17:00.290
And, to make matters worse, 
he got voted "Nicest Celebrity,"

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:01.950
and "Male Celebrity I Most 
Want to Sleep With,"

00:17:00.920 --> 00:17:03.460
<i>He really is immature...</i>

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:04.830
and "Male Celebrity I Most 
Want to Verbally Abuse Me"!

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:07.790
If not for him, I would've 
taken home the triumvirate!

00:17:04.910 --> 00:17:07.790
<b>I don't want to 
sleep with him.</b>

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:07.790
<b>I don't want him to
 verbally abuse me.</b>

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:13.920
Rei! Back up!

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:14.550
Right.

00:17:19.950 --> 00:17:22.810
Hm? He's dressed surprisingly cutely.

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:24.980
If something happens, 
I'll squish that guy like a bug!

00:17:27.890 --> 00:17:29.930
What are they talking about?

00:17:33.160 --> 00:17:35.200
<i>Sorry. Let's get back on topic.</i>

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:35.700
<i>Sure.</i>

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:39.200
In short, during those hard times,

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:41.850
the thing that got me through it all was you.

00:17:43.850 --> 00:17:44.670
<i>Me?</i>

00:17:44.670 --> 00:17:47.140
I told you when we were 
filming the other day, right?

00:17:47.140 --> 00:17:50.880
The color of my good-luck charm
is just like your eyes.

00:17:53.910 --> 00:17:55.800
Every time my heart was on 
the verge of breaking,

00:17:56.520 --> 00:17:58.760
I would look at that good luck
 charm and remember

00:17:59.400 --> 00:18:01.450
your sparkling smile,

00:18:01.450 --> 00:18:04.000
and the sparkling days that surrounded it.

00:18:04.420 --> 00:18:07.000
And I'd find the strength to keep trying my best.

00:18:08.280 --> 00:18:10.770
Even though, when we finally met 
again and I confessed my love,

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:13.040
you turned out to be a guy...

00:18:13.040 --> 00:18:13.690
Yeah...

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:14.800
But...

00:18:16.010 --> 00:18:18.080
Even after I found out you were a guy,

00:18:18.580 --> 00:18:21.160
I couldn't get you out of my head.

00:18:21.690 --> 00:18:23.860
I made tons of mistakes at work.

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:26.300
That's why, on that day,

00:18:26.300 --> 00:18:30.800
I wanted to see you and remind 
myself that you're a guy,

00:18:30.800 --> 00:18:33.720
so that hopefully my feelings 
for you would go away.

00:18:32.690 --> 00:18:34.420
Please! Take off your clothes!

00:18:34.980 --> 00:18:37.400
I expected it all to be 
clean-cut, and done with

00:18:37.400 --> 00:18:39.460
once my brain comprehended 
that you're a guy, but...

00:18:40.210 --> 00:18:40.930
As you know,

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:44.820
<i>what actually happened was a horrible mess...</i>

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:47.850
<i>I'm truly sorry about that.</i>

00:18:49.680 --> 00:18:53.150
But, after that, I had to face the truth.

00:18:53.930 --> 00:18:56.330
My ten years worth of 
feelings for you won't change

00:18:56.330 --> 00:18:59.110
just because you're a guy.

00:19:00.340 --> 00:19:04.030
Even if you're a guy, Izumi, I do love you!

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:20.820
<i>I feel...</i>

00:19:22.150 --> 00:19:24.300
<i>...so bad for him.</i>

00:19:24.880 --> 00:19:27.140
<i>He's faced hardships since childhood,</i>

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:30.880
<i>experienced setbacks and failures 
that warped his personality,</i>

00:19:30.880 --> 00:19:34.300
<i>and then, the girl who was his 
everything for ten whole years</i>

00:19:34.300 --> 00:19:35.730
<i>turns out to be a guy.</i>

00:19:35.970 --> 00:19:40.200
<i>Worse, even after he finds out she's 
a guy, his feelings won't vanish...</i>

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:42.140
<i>Does this make it my fault?</i>

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:47.630
<i>No, it's the fault of the people 
who made me do the commercial.</i>

00:19:48.710 --> 00:19:49.750
Um...

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:51.820
Oh! No, I totally get it!

00:19:51.820 --> 00:19:55.500
It must be rough to have a guy suddenly 
confess his love to you, right?

00:19:55.850 --> 00:19:58.960
I'm not asking you to 
go out with me or anything.

00:19:59.600 --> 00:20:02.610
I just... don't want you to hate me.

00:20:02.610 --> 00:20:06.490
And... if we could just talk normally, 
or go out to eat sometimes...

00:20:06.490 --> 00:20:08.890
In short, I want us to be friends.

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:10.600
Friends?

00:20:11.870 --> 00:20:12.840
So...

00:20:13.520 --> 00:20:14.920
Please!

00:20:16.720 --> 00:20:17.890
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:20:18.560 --> 00:20:20.510
<i>I do feel sorry for him.</i>

00:20:21.540 --> 00:20:23.870
<i>And it is a little bit my fault.</i>

00:20:24.550 --> 00:20:26.820
<i>Plus, I couldn't give him his 
good luck charm back.</i>

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:30.550
<i>And he did treat me to a crepe!</i>

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:30.500
What a good guy!

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:31.370
What a good guy!                                                     Good guy?

00:20:39.220 --> 00:20:41.210
As long as you don't mind 
starting out as texting buddies.

00:20:41.680 --> 00:20:42.610
Really?

00:20:43.170 --> 00:20:43.720
Y-Yeah...

00:20:43.980 --> 00:20:45.970
You're really okay with this?

00:20:46.310 --> 00:20:48.020
Then let's exchange email addresses!

00:20:48.020 --> 00:20:48.940
O-Okay.

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:52.390
<b>Now Transmitting</b>

00:20:52.820 --> 00:20:56.480
Ah, so that's how you write "Izumi."

00:20:56.910 --> 00:20:59.540
The characters are beautiful, 
just like I imagined.

00:21:02.860 --> 00:21:04.700
Then, I'll text you every day from now on.

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:06.080
No. Don't.

00:21:06.650 --> 00:21:07.370
Then—

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:08.370
<i>No!</i>

00:21:08.370 --> 00:21:10.370
<i>But I haven't said anything yet!</i>

00:21:08.370 --> 00:21:10.370
Dang it all!

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:13.920
Ryouma-kun! On top of getting 
to clasp Izumi's hand,

00:21:13.920 --> 00:21:16.720
you're getting his email address now?!

00:21:16.720 --> 00:21:17.580
I won't allow it!

00:21:17.580 --> 00:21:20.300
Oh, what's the harm in something like that?

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:25.300
That car...

00:21:25.300 --> 00:21:26.840
<i>Hey, let's head back.</i>

00:21:25.780 --> 00:21:27.250
Was I imagining things?

00:21:26.840 --> 00:21:27.800
<i>O-Okay.</i>

00:21:28.090 --> 00:21:29.800
I'll walk you home, then.

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:31.440
No, I'm fine.

00:21:32.810 --> 00:21:33.520
Wait!

00:21:33.980 --> 00:21:35.230
How about to the station?

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:36.450
No, I'm fine.

00:21:36.450 --> 00:21:38.320
Okay, how about to the next corner?

00:21:38.320 --> 00:21:40.050
We're practically there.

00:21:40.050 --> 00:21:41.620
Then... how far can I walk with you?

00:21:41.620 --> 00:21:43.530
However far you want.

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:44.720
Then I <i>will</i> walk you home!

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:46.520
No, you really don't have to.

00:23:20.580 --> 00:23:21.420
<b>It's done—</b>

00:23:21.420 --> 00:23:22.420
Switch with me.

00:23:22.420 --> 00:23:23.380
What do I do?

00:23:23.380 --> 00:23:24.380
Why don't you just block him?

00:23:24.620 --> 00:23:26.250
Thank goodness I got through!

00:23:26.250 --> 00:23:27.960
You can't die!

00:23:27.960 --> 00:23:30.700
What a fearsome plan...

00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:34.970
<b><i>Just a Little</i></b>

00:23:32.170 --> 00:23:33.800
Just a little...

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>My manager at B-DASH Agency.</b>
